+\* Active direct Source r38 translation; see the translation review for scope/evidence.
+\* All 21 Source functions have procedure entries. No Frontend/Application calls.
+\* Config is read-only settings.json.backend; Project remains the only data authority.
+\* Platform-neutral primitives: bytes/UTF-8/ZIP STORE CRC32/XML trees, canonical
+\* segment/name operations, copied record construction. Neither ZIP nor XML is executed here.
+CONSTANT NoValue, Missing, BackendSettings
+PACKAGE_FORMAT_VERSION == BackendSettings.project_object.ffpx.formatVersion
+PROJECT_ASSET_DIRECTORIES == BackendSettings.defaults.vfs
+AssetSequenceKind(fileKind) == IF fileKind = "data" THEN "csv" ELSE "image"
