+---- MODULE FastFigureBackendLayoutAnnotationsR38 ----
+EXTENDS Naturals, Integers, Reals, Sequences
+
+\* Active direct Source r38 translation; see the translation review for scope/evidence.
+\* Source: sourcescript/backend/layout_annotations.py r38.
+\* Translates every function in the Source module; imported graph/registry
+\* operations remain explicit dependencies, not opaque replacement algorithms.
+\* ANNOTATION_SETTINGS_RULE / LAYOUT_BOUNDARY_RULE apply to every procedure:
+\* create copies config settings only; instance text/name/ref fields are data;
+\* load fills missing settings, valid false/0/empty persist, no read mutation.
+\* config malformed/missing is an error, not a fallback-code-constant path.
+\* Source public procedure names/signatures are retained. formatLabel and
+\* renderCaptionGroup are call-local expansions of the Source's formatter/group
